  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/348126/Spheres-Apocrypha-Radiant-and-Righteous?affiliate_id=549120\">Spheres Apocrypha: Radiant and Righteous</a></sup></p>\n<p>Deep from within, there is a light that fills you, and you show the world that death is owed nothing.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Berserker sphere (Deathless), Life sphere, Light sphere.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When berserking, you may shed light out to 5 feet. You may spend a spell point to instead shed light as a torch for 1 minute. When berserking while you are below 0 hit points and shedding light with the benefit of this feat, you may forgo the benefits of berserking to instead invigorate yourself and allies within the range of this light.</p>\n<p>While you are below 0 hit points and acting as disabled, you do not take damage for performing a standard action (or actions typically deemed strenuous).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/champion-feats#toc62\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
